From: MiaAI-Lab <MiaAI-Lab@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 11:34:06 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 11/79] flashnext_mia: ranks agree on a prefill's admission
 before either makes its sequence

The two ranks agree on a prefill's admission before either makes its sequence, whose growth runs a collective
(MiaAI-Lab issue #6: a rank that refused with NoRoom left the other in a collective it never joined, until
TF_TP_TIMEOUT_S took both down). The patch and its regression test are by Drake Lu (xinlu8439).

Source: patches/0011-prefill-admission-before-sequence.patch @ MiaAI-Lab/Qwen3.8-Flash-Dual-DGX-Sparks-TensorFold dc05c912342e
Port: applied as is to zig/src/families/flashnext_mia/cuda_lanes.zig (her zig/src/families/flashnext/cuda_lanes.zig).
---
 zig/src/families/flashnext_mia/cuda_lanes.zig | 91 +++++++++++++++----
